# Search-tool ignore rules (ripgrep, and the agent Grep/Glob tools built on it). Git never reads
# this file. It re-includes ONE generated file that .gitignore hides: dist/engineering/codemap.md,
# the map of what lives where, so a plain search for a folder or part name lands on its map row.
# Everything else under dist/ stays out of search. Why: tools/build-codemap.js header.
!/dist/
/dist/*
!/dist/engineering/
/dist/engineering/*
!/dist/engineering/codemap.md
